    <patterns>
      <pattern name="AI facade" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/PublicContracts/">Consume classify/assess/pre-fill through the PublicContracts facade; the external endpoint never touches AI internals (ADR-013/§10).</pattern>
      <pattern name="Triage disposition" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/**/ComposeSummaryPageGenerator.cs:90-102">Reuse BuildRecommendation as the overallRisk→outcome mapping (Low→compliant, Medium→minor, High/Critical→review).</pattern>
      <pattern name="External group + filter" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/">Author the nda/assess route under the Front Door group with the group-level CallerPrincipalAuthorizationFilter on the workforce-plane policy.</pattern>
      <pattern name="App-only pre-fill" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/**/AppOnlyAnalysisService.cs">Re-host the OBO MatterPreFillService pre-fill through the app-only path for outcome (c).</pattern>
    </patterns>
